{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>the best of the land</b> — in gematria גושן (Goshen)." "<b>and you shall place</b> — two times in the Masorah: here and the other ושמתם בארון (and you shall place in the ark). Teaches that they were appointed as officers over the heads of the armies, and their names were written and placed in the king's chest — and this is ושמתם בארון (and you shall place in the ark)."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 47, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:29.158071718Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}